      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"MindWanderer\"]\n\nOh, <em>man</em>, that cover art.  I think this might be my favorite.  I now want that First Appearance Parse promo really, really badly.\n\n[/quote]\n\nI know, right? :D\n\nI can't believe I never considered before that Parse might have changed or been rebooted over the course of Sentinel comics. Seeing that cover, she makes a lot more sense as a character now. All this time, I'd been imagining plus-sized programmer Parse doing all this dark, badass stuff!\n\nAlso, a solid ending gag. And how about that Cooltopia national anthem that's totally canon now? :D\n\nLefty is the hero we all deserve.",
