      "created_at": "2020-02-26T00:41:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I really like Lefty.&nbsp; Since they started out with that \"I feel REAL&nbsp;lucky!&nbsp; Look at me, lucky guy!\"&nbsp; thing, Parse should always refer to him as \"Lucky\", which maybe ultimately culminates in his long term name being \"Lucky Lefty\" Young.&nbsp; (Or \"Lucky Lefty\" Long, if you wanna go real Marvel-style on it.)</p>",
